The Raiders' "Indian Reservation" entered the [[Billboard Hot 100|''Billboard'' Hot 100]] on April 10, 1971. On July 24, it reached the top spot for a single week. "Indian Reservation" spent a total of 22 weeks on the ''Billboard'' Hot 100 chart.<ref name="Bronson" />

